WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.950
Instructor: Okay, so the last thing I'll show you

00:01.950 --> 00:03.540
is how to drop stashes,

00:03.540 --> 00:05.010
how to remove them.

00:05.010 --> 00:07.260
And all we do is use "git stash drop"

00:07.260 --> 00:11.520
and then a stash identifier, index, whatever this is called.

00:11.520 --> 00:13.710
Now, this is something you only need to do

00:13.710 --> 00:15.540
if you're not using pop, for example.

00:15.540 --> 00:17.460
Pop just removes it from the stash anyway.

00:17.460 --> 00:20.040
It removes the most recent thing in the stash

00:20.040 --> 00:21.330
and applies it.

00:21.330 --> 00:23.040
So if you aren't using pop,

00:23.040 --> 00:25.620
and you're instead applying particular stashes

00:25.620 --> 00:29.040
or you're using just "apply" to apply the most recent,

00:29.040 --> 00:31.260
you're not clearing out the stash at any point.

00:31.260 --> 00:33.840
So, we can drop particular things,

00:33.840 --> 00:37.500
particular entries in the stash with this syntax.

00:37.500 --> 00:42.150
Okay, so back to our little website, a beautiful webpage.

